<title>ESTONIA: EXPORT PRICE INDEX UP 0.9 PCT MO/MO IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>EXPORT PRICE INDEX UP 0.9 PCT MO/MO IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Export Price Index rose by a month-on-month 0.9 percent in March compared to February's monthly 1.1 percent rise, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p>  EXPORT PRICE INDEX	Mar 97    Feb 97    Mar 96</p>
<p>  Month-on-month change    0.9	  1.1	-0.5</p>
<p>  Year-on-year change	7.8	  6.3	11.9</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
